WEBVTT

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:28.830
It's an ambush!

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:34.700
You think you can take over someone
else's territory? Not in a hundred years!

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:40.410
A tank?!

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:52.950
What the hell did you do to my store?!

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:07.700
Mario, you okay?

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:14.410
Mario!
We're gonna let the civilians escape.

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:17.000
-Pull back all the way to west gate.
-Let's go!

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.160
Were you able to send for outside help?

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
Yeah. We were able to send out
a few young ones from the west gate.

00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:28.700
<i>Thanks to the mess at the main gate.</i>

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:33.200
I told him a decoy's enough, but Mr. Kidow
can be so meddlesome himself.

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:36.160
Oh, yeah, what about that girl?

00:01:36.410 --> 00:01:38.080
You know, Mr. Kidow's girlfriend?

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:40.620
He says she's not coming back...

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:42.580
Same for that idiot.

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:44.410
I see...

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:48.540
But I said I'll be waiting,

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:51.620
so I won't leave this place
even if it means dying.

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:32.540
The right! Aim for his human side!

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:37.200
Damn monster...

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:51.410
<i>This building will now be</i>
<i>on a state of alert.</i>

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:57.450
<i>The use of elevators as well as</i>
<i>automatic doors will become limited.</i>

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:05.250
I have to get to the top floor...

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:10.120
<i>The Exterminator of the Far East</i>
<i>intruded the main tower!</i>

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.620
<i>The rifles won't work on</i>
<i>Specimen No. 8!</i>

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:17.120
It's a free-for-all.

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:20.830
Prioritize the removal of the intruder
and Specimen No. 8.

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:23.120
Authorize level four use of firearms.

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:25.750
Damages in either towers are unavoidable.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:30.040
The girl has been spotted on
the main tower's 33rd-floor camera.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.330
<i>Lock down the main tower's 33rd floor.</i>

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:34.870
<i>Hurry and seize the girl.</i>

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:38.040
Why aren't you staying put?!

00:04:39.950 --> 00:04:41.370
-There he is!
-Damn it!

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:07.080
Are they... dead?

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:08.160
<i>They're alive.</i>

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:11.910
<i>They've been put to sleep</i>
<i>for testing commands.</i>

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:14.620
If it's inside the main tower,

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:17.910
Tania's commands
reach the bugs with more detail.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:21.700
Once we can give out instructions
to individual Cagasters,

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.700
it'll no longer be a dream
to divert them to military use.

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:27.370
<i>Military? You mean to use them for war?</i>

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:29.620
Don't say anything unnecessary.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:31.080
Yes, yes.

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:34.870
<i>We'll send someone to get you,</i>
<i>so be good and stay there.</i>

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:39.830
<i>Upsetting His Excellency further</i>
<i>won't do you any good.</i>

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:42.790
Mom!

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:44.330
Mom!

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:45.910
<i>Mom!</i>

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:47.330
<i>Where are you?</i>

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:51.080
Deep-sea fish?

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:55.040
If we released the aquarium's pressure,
they would suffocate and die.

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:57.870
They're creatures that
we'd normally never meet.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:02.750
<i>Normally, we would've been</i>
<i>born in the form of bugs.</i>

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:06.830
<i>We would've lived and died inside this</i>
<i>insect cage without knowing humans.</i>

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:09.870
<i>But I...</i>

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.080
Stand up. Come over here.

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:19.160
<i>Mom...</i>

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:21.160
<i>Mom, tell me.</i>

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:24.500
<i>How am I supposed to live?</i>

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:29.790
Mom...

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:41.290
<i>Ilie...</i>

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:51.120
<i>-The bug!</i>
<i>-Retreat! Fall back!</i>

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:52.370
What happened?!

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:55.370
-Any abnormalities with the throne?
-No, sir.

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:06.950
Damn it, my bullets!

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:09.040
No! Don't eat them!

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:09.950
Please!

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:20.660
Did I... wake them?

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:39.120
Even if all of them
have a predictable ending,

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:41.370
you gotta choose one yourself.

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:44.370
I see.

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:51.950
So, this... is the answer...

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:55.290
Franz!

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:57.700
I am the next queen of this cage!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:07:59.910
<i>If you don't want to die, leave!</i>

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:03.830
I won't let you do as you please with Mom
or the insect cage anymore!

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:15.540
What about the Cagasters
in the entire cage?

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:17.120
There aren't any problems.

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:20.040
We've only lost control
of the bugs in that room.

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:22.790
Maximize the power of the throne.

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:25.790
Your Excellency, but that
would affect the queen's body...

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:27.540
Are you really sure?

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:29.250
There's no choice.

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:32.370
This one's not as obedient as Tania.

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:36.000
<i>Imperial Ordinance System, full power.</i>

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:53.580
What a complete mess...

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:02.290
Cagasters?

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:03.750
How come?

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:09.450
Ilie!

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:30.040
This is your last chance.

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:31.700
Bow to our will.

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:37.040
Then will you jump from there and die?

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:39.040
I would never kill myself.

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:41.330
If you want to kill me, shoot.

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:43.200
Franz.

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:45.830
Now you'll have one less thing
to worry about.

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:48.500
You said

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:51.370
you didn't want to leave
your DNA behind, right?

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:55.370
But the blood that's about
to be spilled is my own blood.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:57.540
Not my mother's, not yours,

00:09:57.790 --> 00:09:59.370
and not Emeth Chilio's!

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:02.410
It's definite proof that I lived and died!

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:24.500
I'm so... stupid...

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:35.540
The Exterminator!

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:48.870
Franz...

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:55.410
Ilie... Ilie!

00:10:59.540 --> 00:11:00.450
You okay?

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:02.200
What?

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:03.910
Kidow?

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:08.200
You wouldn't stay put, so I had to
go through a lot just to get here.

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:13.660
Why are you here?

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:15.160
What?

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:17.160
What about Lizzy and them?
Are they okay?

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:23.160
Do you know why I was
brought to a place like this?

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:26.160
You asked me before...

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:28.950
why I left Area A.

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:30.750
I...

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:34.450
I know most of the story.

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:36.950
Save the questions
for when we get out of here.

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:39.250
No! Let me down, Kidow!

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:40.580
No!

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:45.040
What are you doing? Let go, stupid!

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:51.620
Among the lab workers who
were killed by Specimen No. 8,

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:53.580
there was a body that took a bullet.

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:56.160
If I remember correctly,

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:59.410
that thing doesn't know
how to use guns, right, Franz?

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:05.120
You were probably going to kill me
amid Specimen No. 8's revolt,

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:07.580
but did you suddenly
develop affection

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:09.200
for your daughter after a decade?

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:10.290
Of course not.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:13.160
I haven't changed one bit.

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:18.450
My desire is to chase the
Cagaster's truth in place of my father.

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:20.830
Everything else is unimportant.

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:23.370
That's what you say now...

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:28.160
We know that you don't agree
with our ideals.

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:32.830
We wanted the completion
of Emeth Chilio's research.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:36.700
You wanted the equipment
and funds for research.

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:40.580
We only had mutual interests
up till today.

00:12:40.910 --> 00:12:42.250
Let me ask you once again.

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:45.000
Now that you've risen against us,

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:48.200
what was the truth that you found?

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:52.120
That day,
the one who died in the Far East...

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:55.250
<i>was not Emeth Chilio.</i>

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:01.160
My father's soul possessed this body

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:03.660
and the one who died was his son, Franz.

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:07.620
The one you picked up
was Emeth Chilio's ghost.

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:12.370
Then the truth I longed for

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:14.700
should never have changed from that day.

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:24.910
Don't be alarmed,

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:28.700
they're controlled so that they
don't attack people inside the cage.

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:32.700
As long as we have the queen,
these guys are just...

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:39.950
<i>Help me! Help!</i>

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:45.120
<i>The Imperial Ordinance System</i>
<i>has an issue!</i>

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:46.750
<i>The program is being rewritten!</i>

00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:47.660
Impossible!

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:50.250
Franz, what did you do?

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:57.290
Code 8088 is something I added
when I completed the throne.

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:01.040
It rewrites the program when
the throne's power is maximized.

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:06.160
Starting now, the queen will allow feeding
inside the insect cage for one hour.

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:08.410
With one hour,

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:11.660
I'm sure the plate will be wiped clean
without any trace of crumbs.

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:13.250
You bastard...

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:15.700
Unfortunately, you crossed the line.

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.660
Cagasters are the human evolution

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.040
and they will create a world of only bugs.

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:23.950
That is Emeth Chilio's wish.

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:30.700
Are you saying you've lived
to today just to see this through?

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:34.040
No...

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:37.870
You only wanted to act as a ghost.

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:40.120
Even though...

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:43.040
you realized long ago
how pointless it was...

00:14:58.830 --> 00:14:59.660
I'm alive...

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:09.450
If I'm alive,

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:12.660
then there's only one thing to do.

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:17.410
Just watch.

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:21.200
Your twin will live
this life to the fullest.

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.870
By my own will, till the very end.

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:29.000
It's a bit tough...

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:31.750
<i>but we're both...</i>

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:34.120
almost done, right?

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:53.040
Ilie is a very important friend.

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:56.660
God, please save Ilie.

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:58.700
I beg you please.

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:00.750
All of you, hurry!

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:04.790
Now, let's go.

00:16:06.200 --> 00:16:07.750
-Naji.
-I'm fine.

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:14.870
Aisha, hurry and evacuate the civilians!

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:16.660
The west gate won't hold any longer!

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:18.160
Come on, let's go.

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:23.910
-Did they all go?
-Yeah.

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:25.500
Good.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.660
Now, let's kick some ass!

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:30.290
Yeah!

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:36.410
Aren't we at Azuria yet?

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:38.370
We should be close.

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:42.790
I see it! The gate's lighthouse!

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:56.910
Damn it...

00:16:57.120 --> 00:17:00.290
We can't get eaten in a place like this!

00:17:06.870 --> 00:17:07.700
What?

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:20.580
This is a controlled area of the
commercial federation city, Azuria.

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:22.450
Whether you're bug or man,

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:26.750
if you do not have permission for access,
know that we will remove you by force.

00:17:27.370 --> 00:17:28.290
Please wait.

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:30.410
We are messengers from E-05.

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:33.700
We'd like to ask for your support.
Let us speak to your superiors.

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:41.000
We'll hold out for an hour and
take back control of the throne.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:43.250
After that,

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:46.330
we will become the real kings
who control the Cagasters.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:47.250
Yes, sir!

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:49.250
<i>Nothing's changed.</i>

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:51.200
<i>From the days in the Far East...</i>

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:53.830
<i>Nothing.</i>

00:17:57.120 --> 00:17:59.120
<i>Attention, all troops</i>
<i>in the entire facility!</i>

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:01.330
<i>Due to Franz Chilio's revolt,</i>

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:03.700
<i>control over Cagasters has been lost.</i>

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:05.450
<i>Starting now, for one hour,</i>

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:08.250
<i>all individuals put every</i>
<i>effort into survival!</i>

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:11.330
So now, we're in a real insect cage...

00:18:12.330 --> 00:18:14.370
We'll be finished if we don't hurry.
Let's go.

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:16.830
I can't go with you.

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:20.250
Because you found out
you were the queen of the bugs?

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:23.000
Because I turn people into bugs.

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:24.790
You know, right?

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:28.700
That my mother was the one
who turned 07 into an insect cage.

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:32.040
Turning the ones
with the gene into bugs...

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:34.040
And the ones without into food...

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.660
I can't live in the human world.

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:42.160
I'll probably turn people into bugs again.

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:45.700
You're going to go back to
killing those suffering people

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:47.580
as they turn into bugs.

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:50.160
Well, that's not your concern.

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:53.000
Your reason to stay here

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:55.370
and me being an Exterminator
have no connection.

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:57.370
And what?

00:18:57.750 --> 00:19:00.660
You're not gonna stay here to
cooperate with those guys, are you?

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:03.870
I'm gonna take back this insect cage

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:05.830
and become the queen here.

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:08.080
If there's no throne,

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:11.120
Adham and his men
can't control the Cagasters.

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:13.250
Even if that means...

00:19:13.620 --> 00:19:15.910
taking my mother's life,

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:17.950
I want to stop the throne.

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:23.830
And I came here because I believed you
when you said not to leave you alone.

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:27.080
That's not what I'm thinking now.

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:28.910
It's as if I was dreaming.

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:32.410
Once I woke up,
all those feelings went away somewhere.

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:34.330
How cold-hearted...

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:37.910
Well, that's more my type, though.

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:41.200
So, Princess.

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:45.620
Tell me how you're gonna fight
when you face Adham.

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:48.950
If they were the kind
of people to run off,

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:51.750
I don't think they would've been
in an insect cage to start.

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:54.040
They'd probably head for the throne.

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:56.500
To take back control right away.

00:19:57.750 --> 00:19:58.580
Or what?

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:02.450
Are you saying, "I'm a monster
who turns everyone into bugs,

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:05.700
so honestly, I want to
sacrifice myself and die"?

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:09.450
No!

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:11.250
Then use your head.

00:20:11.910 --> 00:20:14.120
Who's this guy before your eyes?

00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:16.080
-What?
-He's an idiot

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:18.910
who'd break into an insect cage,
lured in by some sweet talk.

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:21.000
On top of that, that idiot

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:23.200
is a professional from the Far East.

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:26.910
Instead of pushing him away, it's smarter
to use him, then dump him.

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:28.870
If you say the word,

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:32.080
the Exterminator's sword
will be yours for just now.

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:34.660
You don't think anything of me, right?

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:38.200
Then why not seduce him and use him up?

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:40.290
Why...?

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:43.330
You didn't have any interest in me.

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:46.160
That's what I thought, too.

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:48.410
You're stupid...

00:20:49.540 --> 00:20:50.500
I think so, too.

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:54.910
I only want the throne.

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:58.080
My reason to survive right now is to

00:20:58.660 --> 00:21:00.620
take back the insect cage
from those people.

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:02.620
That's why,

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:05.120
if you can grant me my wish,

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:07.660
you can do

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:10.080
whatever you want afterwards.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:12.910
Sure.

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:16.410
Don't forget it, Princess.

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:20.120
Be prepared if everything goes well.

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:26.830
If it goes well...

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:45.410
Once we neutralize this area,
the control tower will be in sight.

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:48.200
Destroy them with all
our power till the end.

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:52.790
The mayor will see you.

00:21:53.290 --> 00:21:54.120
Wait here.

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:55.830
What's with this treatment?

00:21:55.950 --> 00:21:56.870
Keep it to yourself.

00:21:57.250 --> 00:21:59.620
It's a miracle to even
have them listen to us.

00:22:11.750 --> 00:22:12.750
Mayor!

00:22:12.950 --> 00:22:14.580
Welcome to Azuria.

00:22:14.950 --> 00:22:17.040
What do the people of E-05,

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:19.790
who are under the Allied Forces
numbering, need?

00:22:20.120 --> 00:22:25.750
E-05 is under attack by the Allied Forces.
There have been many civilian deaths, too.

00:22:26.410 --> 00:22:28.580
We would like to ask for your support.

00:22:29.330 --> 00:22:31.830
In exchange, we will grant
you privilege in trade...

00:22:34.120 --> 00:22:38.000
About a month ago, there was a serviceman
who requested our cooperation,

00:22:38.700 --> 00:22:42.000
saying that there was
a possibility of revolt at 05.

00:22:42.410 --> 00:22:46.660
And you two fell into our trap perfectly.

00:22:47.500 --> 00:22:48.450
The Allied Forces...

00:22:50.200 --> 00:22:51.410
You guys were together?!

00:22:53.200 --> 00:22:57.250
It's admirable to be young
and have love for your homeland,

00:22:57.950 --> 00:23:01.410
but if you show your hand first,

00:23:01.950 --> 00:23:04.700
you're more of an errand boy
than an envoy.

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:12.700
Damn it...

00:23:13.080 --> 00:23:13.910
Mario...

00:23:14.700 --> 00:23:17.580
Maybe it's really over now...

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:19.950
Of course it isn't!

00:23:20.410 --> 00:23:21.790
The day will soon break.

00:23:21.870 --> 00:23:22.700
But...

00:23:23.540 --> 00:23:24.700
Stand up properly!

00:23:27.040 --> 00:23:29.250
Morning only comes to those...

00:23:30.750 --> 00:23:32.000
who've withstood the dark.
